# Firewall Rules

## SSH Access

| Setting | Value |
|---------|-------|
| Action | Pass |
| Interface | LAN |
| Protocol | TCP |
| Source | LAN net |
| Destination | This Firewall |
| Port | SSH (22) |

Purpose:
Allow secure remote administration of the pfSense firewall from the LAN.

---

## Default LAN Rule

The default LAN rule allows outbound traffic from LAN clients unless restricted by additional rules.
